---
title: A section without an anchor between two anchored ones
---

## Cream ~{-3d} ->&cream

[Whisk] Whisk @egg yolks{6} with @sugar{100g} and @milk{500ml}.

[Chill] Chill ~_{24h}.

## Filling

[Mix] Mix &cream{300g} with @almond flour{100g}.

## Tart ~{-1d}

[Bake] Pour the filling into a #tart tin and bake ~{40min} at ^{180C}.
